          "content": "Figure it Out"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.153,
            0.741,
            0.2
          ],
          "content": "1. Which is greater: $( a - b ) ^ { 2 }$ or $( b - a ) ^ { 2 } ?$ Justify your answer. **Ans.** Both are equal."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.21,
            0.634,
            0.23
          ],
          "content": "2. Express 100 as the difference of two squares."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.236,
            0.724,
            0.256
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** Try to find square numbers with a difference of 100."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.364,
            0.26,
            0.692,
            0.482
          ],
          "content": "| a | b | Difference |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 25 | 125 | Not a square |\n| 36 | 136 | Not a square |\n| 49 | 149 | Not a square |\n| . |  |  |\n| . |  |  |\n| . |  |  |\n| 676 | 576 | Square |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_27_table_5.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.497,
            0.379,
            0.516
          ],
          "content": "676 – 576 = 100 or"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.203,
            0.516,
            0.346,
            0.535
          ],
          "content": "26<sup>2</sup> – 24<sup>2</sup> = 100"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.537,
            0.506,
            0.556
          ],
          "content": "Check for more such numbers."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.565,
            0.846,
            0.605
          ],
          "content": "3. Find 406<sup>2</sup>, 72<sup>2</sup>, 145<sup>2</sup>, 1097<sup>2</sup>, and 124<sup>2</sup> using the identities you have learnt so far."
